    {
      "id": "u_1e482030390be482679bf025_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This functionality is still in preview, expect possible issues or even the feature disappearing completely.__TRILIUM_PH_0__Feel free to __TRILIUM_PH_1__report__TRILIUM_PH_2__ any issues you might have.",
      "sourceHash": "1e482030390be482679bf02514b61c0a177d4c99f23234421451da2f5869bf20",
      "context": "Read-only database",
      "contextHash": "4968660b1e567e4c4ef71a6e2141583692e98ccc3255e8e543501403ee437264",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_52098527303315e6b3051e35_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The read-only database is an alternative to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Sharing__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes. Although the share functionality works pretty well to publish pages to the Internet in a wiki, blog-like format it does not offer the full functionality behind Trilium (such as the advanced __TRILIUM_PH_2__Search__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or the interactivity behind __TRILIUM_PH_4__Collections__TRILIUM_PH_5__ or the various __TRILIUM_PH_6__Note Types__TRILIUM_PH_7__).",
      "sourceHash": "52098527303315e6b3051e35f4ed43e8686272e1c2ff8cad672c5c726a11b97a",
      "context": "Read-only database",
      "contextHash": "4968660b1e567e4c4ef71a6e2141583692e98ccc3255e8e543501403ee437264",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8432739956afc91ade77a20f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When the database is in read-only mode, the Trilium application can be used as normal, but editing is disabled and changes are made in-memory only.",
      "sourceHash": "8432739956afc91ade77a20fcd6dadfbf8d3199b658cfa2a70cf8e5708cbf4e3",
      "context": "Read-only database",
      "contextHash": "4968660b1e567e4c4ef71a6e2141583692e98ccc3255e8e543501403ee437264",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7a6b5655061597ade237250b_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "What it does__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "7a6b5655061597ade237250b4920f5c49fcaf16fcad5e69f80011cf264276be4",
      "context": "Read-only database > What it does",
      "contextHash": "f8f8420b12422b598db0516af5d0e0f10b71916825da7be5e574c88a5a1a410c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_58570acb5ed8f78ba57d1d6c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "All notes are read-only, without the possibility of editing them.",
      "sourceHash": "58570acb5ed8f78ba57d1d6c8d2109baa65492ea4956cdb26ac7d201f2b9a189",
      "context": "Read-only database > What it does",
      "contextHash": "f8f8420b12422b598db0516af5d0e0f10b71916825da7be5e574c88a5a1a410c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1e17a85f19575b28192670fc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Features that would normally alter the database such as the list of recent notes are disabled.",
      "sourceHash": "1e17a85f19575b28192670fca5a3cba0735a7922fff38c18ed1e80b2013f1aa7",
      "context": "Read-only database > What it does",
      "contextHash": "f8f8420b12422b598db0516af5d0e0f10b71916825da7be5e574c88a5a1a410c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3feba2dbd0d28887b22a99884dc255c7ff2e43988d",
      "context": "Read-only database > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "9ab6b6b6f1b519d0b091bdd70cde1dea8e919b890279a53456b3fec49c4a3e30",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9753455e6c45e2cec9530063_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Some features might “slip through” and still end up creating a note, for example.",
      "sourceHash": "9753455e6c45e2cec953006339bc0883ff9ec6e304b8733aadea45cc1930bf8e",
      "context": "Read-only database > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "9ab6b6b6f1b519d0b091bdd70cde1dea8e919b890279a53456b3fec49c4a3e30",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a09ec1ddda1cd7e01cae4d84_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "However, the database is still read-only, so all modifications will be reset if the server is restarted.",
      "sourceHash": "a09ec1ddda1cd7e01cae4d840455bd4c42ad1920ae313247ace9c140ddaecb2b",
      "context": "Read-only database > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "9ab6b6b6f1b519d0b091bdd70cde1dea8e919b890279a53456b3fec49c4a3e30",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1a284aabf80daa5b2c772ef2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Whenever this occurs, __TRILIUM_PH_0__ will be shown in the logs.",
      "sourceHash": "1a284aabf80daa5b2c772ef22e24eb35b896fe113445b77b0a062b08034cf8f5",
      "context": "Read-only database > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "9ab6b6b6f1b519d0b091bdd70cde1dea8e919b890279a53456b3fec49c4a3e30",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e8d657d2899ff9fb1de1bdc3_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Setting a database as read-only__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "e8d657d2899ff9fb1de1bdc394b41713c846096db6f3df2f4dc08d445dcfdb18",
      "context": "Read-only database > Setting a database as read-only",
      "contextHash": "712ead9907a89b943b76ae14eb2f540431732d10944a0cf22d20822c5a2ede8a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a03b4539fe419ad9daa0b89d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "First, make sure the database is initialized (e.g. the first set up is complete). Then modify the __TRILIUM_PH_0__config.ini__TRILIUM_PH_1__ by looking for the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ section and adding a new __TRILIUM_PH_3__ field:",
      "sourceHash": "a03b4539fe419ad9daa0b89dee5ed0196cfa2670ee213be4ad2e6c27ac51986b",
      "context": "Read-only database > Setting a database as read-only",
      "contextHash": "712ead9907a89b943b76ae14eb2f540431732d10944a0cf22d20822c5a2ede8a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_673ffbc7a23978501f8e5e58_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If your server is already running, restart it to apply the changes.",
      "sourceHash": "673ffbc7a23978501f8e5e58e320794cc4f89943ea9f461fa1a9787112490e01",
      "context": "Read-only database > Setting a database as read-only",
      "contextHash": "712ead9907a89b943b76ae14eb2f540431732d10944a0cf22d20822c5a2ede8a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e626c3769c3ebb045e669168_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Similarly, to disable read-only remove the line or set it to __TRILIUM_PH_0__.",
      "sourceHash": "e626c3769c3ebb045e669168a15e5d4469b332c77144c4aa4fa92fa2904cb653",
      "context": "Read-only database > Setting a database as read-only",
      "contextHash": "712ead9907a89b943b76ae14eb2f540431732d10944a0cf22d20822c5a2ede8a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    }
  ],
